&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Lake Abilene Closures&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Oct. 20, 2025 - Due to the lake's low level:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Boat ramps are closed;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kayak rentals are not available;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Swimming and fishing are not allowed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The entire lake will be closed on the following dates:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10 p.m. on Nov. 29 to 3 p.m. Dec. 10&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10 p.m. on Jan. 15 to 10 p.m. Jan. 31&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10 p.m. on Feb. 4 to 3 p.m. Feb. 7&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10 p.m. on Feb. 12 to 10 p.m. Feb. 28&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Only permitted hunters will be allowed on these dates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contact the park or check back for updates.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;Park Closures&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The park will be closed on the following dates:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Noon on Nov. 30 to 8 a.m. on Dec. 4&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Noon on Dec. 27 to 8 a.m. on Dec. 31&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Noon on Jan. 15 to 8 a.m. on Jan. 19&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Only permitted hunters will be allowed on these dates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contact the park for more information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Check back for updates.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;Screwworm Alert&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href='https://tpwd.texas.gov/huntwild/wild/diseases/screwworm/' data-linktype='external' data-val='https://tpwd.texas.gov/huntwild/wild/diseases/screwworm/'&gt;New world screwworm &lt;/a&gt;has been found in parts of Texas.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Check your pets and livestock often.&lt;/strong&gt; If you see unusual wounds or maggots, &lt;strong&gt;do not move the animal&lt;/strong&gt;. Call the Texas Animal Health Commission at (800) 550‑8242 or contact a private veterinarian.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For &lt;strong&gt;wildlife&lt;/strong&gt; with suspicious wounds or maggots, notify park staff or call (512) 389‑4505.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;Reservations Recommended&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Jan. 1, 2026 - We strongly encourage you to&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href='https://texasstateparks.reserveamerica.com/balmorhea-state-park/r/facilityDetails.do?contractCode=TX&amp;amp;parkId=1200011&amp;amp;_ga=2.156610558.498297970.1652709452-1186141045.1645140964' data-linktype='external' data-val='https://texasstateparks.reserveamerica.com/balmorhea-state-park/r/facilityDetails.do?contractCode=TX&amp;amp;parkId=1200011&amp;amp;_ga=2.156610558.498297970.1652709452-1186141045.1645140964'&gt;purchase day passes&lt;/a&gt; in advance for the summer months, weekends, school breaks and holidays. Day passes often sell out throughout the summer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Online reservations for overnight stays close at 4:30 p.m.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Check back for updates.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;Screwworm Alert&lt;/h3&gt;
