&lt;h3&gt;Burn Ban&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Oct. 19, 2026 - The park is under a burn ban. No wood fires allowed. You may use charcoal or containerized fuel stoves (i.e. propane) for cooking only.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Lake Notice&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;June 23, 2026 - The main lake is open but is not yet stocked. Fishing is available at Lake Mina.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Check here for updates.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;Park Closed for Construction&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Jan. 1, 2026 - The park is closed to all public access as it is under construction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Check back for updates.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

