&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span data-ogsc='black'&gt;&lt;span class='mark1qh55xz9j' data-markjs='true' data-ogac='' data-ogab='' data-ogsc='' data-ogsb='' data-ogsbtc='' data-ogsbrc='' data-ogsbbc='' data-ogsblc='' data-olk-copy-source='MessageBody'&gt;Holiday&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class='markx800977df' data-markjs='true' data-ogac='' data-ogab='' data-ogsc='' data-ogsb='' data-ogsbtc='' data-ogsbrc='' data-ogsbbc='' data-ogsblc=''&gt;Hours&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ogsc='black'&gt;The park will remain open throughout the &lt;span class='mark1qh55xz9j' data-markjs='true' data-ogac='' data-ogab='' data-ogsc='' data-ogsb='' data-ogsbtc='' data-ogsbrc='' data-ogsbbc='' data-ogsblc=''&gt;holiday&lt;/span&gt;s. The office will be closed during the following times:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-ogsc='black'&gt;Thanksgiving Day, Nov. 26: closing at 12:30 p.m.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-ogsc='black'&gt;Christmas Eve, Dec. 24: closing at 2:30 p.m.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-ogsc='black'&gt;Christmas Day, Dec. 25:&amp;nbsp;closing at 12:30 p.m.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Check back for updates.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;Holiday Hours&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The park will remain open throughout the holidays. The office will be closed during the following times:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thanksgiving, Nov. 26, 2026 - Closing at 10 a.m.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Christmas Eve, Dec. 24, 2026 - Closing at 10 a.m.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Christmas Day, Dec. 25, 2026 - Closed all day&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you plan to visit during this time, please &lt;a href='https://texasstateparks.reserveamerica.com/camping/bonham-state-park/r/facilityDetails.do?contractCode=TX&amp;amp;parkId=1200112&amp;amp;pk_vid=a49839bda92fa2ba179303099787860a' data-linktype='external' data-val='https://texasstateparks.reserveamerica.com/camping/bonham-state-park/r/facilityDetails.do?contractCode=TX&amp;amp;parkId=1200112&amp;amp;pk_vid=a49839bda92fa2ba179303099787860a'&gt;make reservations online&lt;/a&gt; or use the self-pay station at park headquarters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Hydrilla Alert&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sept. 1, 2025 - The lake is infested with hydrilla, an invasive plant that creates large mats of vegetation across the surface of the water. We are working on controlling and removing the hydrilla, but it can affect swimming, fishing and boating.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please remember to always clean, drain and dry your boat!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Check back for updates.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;Burn Ban&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Aug. 28, 2026 - The park is under a burn ban. No wood fires allowed. You may use charcoal or containerized stoves (i.e. propane) for cooking only.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Special Event&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Brazos Bend 100 Trail Race will take place in the park Dec. 5 and 6, 2026. Expect limited parking and increased traffic on the trails.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Day entrance will be first-come, first-served on Dec. 5, 2026. Day use passes will not be reservable. Contact the park for questions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Scheduled Water Outage&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The park water system will be under maintenance on Oct. 21, 2026. Water &lt;strong&gt;will not be&lt;/strong&gt; available in the following areas:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;All Camping Loops&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nature Center&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elm Lake and Hale Lake Day Use areas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Water and restrooms will be available at park headquarters and the&amp;nbsp;40 Acre Lake Day Use area.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Park Closures&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The park will be closed on the following dates:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nov. 17 to Nov. 19&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dec. 15 to Dec. 17&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The group camp area, equestrian trails and pavilion will be closed on the following dates:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oct. 24 to Oct. 25&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Only permitted hunters will be allowed on these dates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contact the park for more information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Check back for updates.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;Screwworm Alert&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href='https://tpwd.texas.gov/huntwild/wild/diseases/screwworm/' data-linktype='external' data-val='https://tpwd.texas.gov/huntwild/wild/diseases/screwworm/'&gt;New world screwworm &lt;/a&gt;has been found in parts of Texas.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
