&lt;p&gt;The park will be closed on the following dates:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3:30 p.m. on Nov. 20 to 8 a.m. on Nov. 24&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3:30 p.m. on Dec. 18 to 8 a.m. on Dec. 22&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3:30 p.m. on Jan. 7 to 8 a.m. on Jan. 11&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3:30 p.m. on Feb. 4 to 8 a.m. on Feb. 8&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Only permitted hunters will be allowed on these dates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contact the park for more information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contact the park for more information.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;Trails &amp;amp; Tracks&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-val='ff7e3112be4b4a5f837553b31898cf7a' href='https://tpwd.texas.gov/state-parks/park-information/notices/trails-tracks-promo' data-linktype='internal'&gt;Check for updates.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
