&lt;p&gt;The park will be closed on the following dates:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10 p.m. on Dec. 6 to noon on Dec. 10&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10 p.m. on Jan. 10 to noon on Jan. 14&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Only permitted hunters will be allowed on these dates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contact the park for more information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Reservations Recommended&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;We often reach capacity and highly recommend reservations for both camping and day use.&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href='https://texasstateparks.reserveamerica.com/camping/dinosaur-valley-state-park/r/facilityDetails.do?contractCode=TX&amp;amp;parkId=1200095&amp;amp;_ga=2.264897035.546344660.1588003601-486977258.1574702617' data-linktype='external' data-val='https://texasstateparks.reserveamerica.com/camping/dinosaur-valley-state-park/r/facilityDetails.do?contractCode=TX&amp;amp;parkId=1200095&amp;amp;_ga=2.264897035.546344660.1588003601-486977258.1574702617'&gt;Reserve passes online&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;or by&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href='https://tpwd.texas.gov/state-parks/park-reservation-information/reservations#phone'&gt;calling the customer service center&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;before you visit.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Check back for updates.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;Road Construction&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;April 28, 2026 - Due to construction, take Exit 72 off Highway 75 to visit the park.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Facility Closures&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;May 7, 2026 &amp;ndash; Fossil Ridge fishing pier is closed.&lt;/p&gt;
