&lt;p&gt;Trails close in wet conditions. &lt;a data-val='13766029c2c04a3fbd1908b2088da104' href='https://tpwd.texas.gov/state-parks/park-information/notices/eisenhower-alert-promo' data-linktype='internal'&gt;Check for updates&lt;/a&gt; before visiting.&lt;/p&gt;
