&lt;li&gt;12:30 p.m. on Jan. 25 to 2 p.m. on Jan. 29&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Only permitted hunters will be allowed on these dates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contact the park for more information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Visiting Enchanted Rock&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Please use water wisely when you visit. Bring your own drinking water or you can buy bottled water at headquarters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced reservations for day passes and overnight stays are required on weekends, school breaks and holidays. While not required on regular weekdays, we usually reach capacity every day. Guarantee your entry by&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href='https://texasstateparks.reserveamerica.com/camping/enchanted-rock-state-natural-area/r/facilityDetails.do?contractCode=TX&amp;amp;parkId=1200056&amp;amp;_ga=2.97845915.546344660.1588003601-486977258.1574702617' data-linktype='external' data-val='https://texasstateparks.reserveamerica.com/camping/enchanted-rock-state-natural-area/r/facilityDetails.do?contractCode=TX&amp;amp;parkId=1200056&amp;amp;_ga=2.97845915.546344660.1588003601-486977258.1574702617'&gt;reserving passes online&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;or &lt;a href='https://tpwd.texas.gov/state-parks/park-reservation-information/reservations#phone'&gt;calling the customer service center&lt;/a&gt; before you visit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Get&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-val='84219363e2e0403dbb569c82261bdb22' href='https://tpwd.texas.gov/state-parks/park-information/notices/erock-trails-update' data-linktype='internal'&gt;trail status updates here&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;or on&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href='https://www.facebook.com/enchantedrock/'&gt;our Facebook page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Check back for updates.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;Screwworm Alert&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href='https://tpwd.texas.gov/huntwild/wild/diseases/screwworm/' data-linktype='external' data-val='https://tpwd.texas.gov/huntwild/wild/diseases/screwworm/'&gt;New world screwworm &lt;/a&gt;has been found in parts of Texas.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Check your pets and livestock often.&lt;/strong&gt; If you see unusual wounds or maggots, &lt;strong&gt;do not move the animal&lt;/strong&gt;. Call the Texas Animal Health Commission at (800) 550‑8242 or contact a private veterinarian.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For &lt;strong&gt;wildlife&lt;/strong&gt; with suspicious wounds or maggots, notify park staff or call (512) 389‑4505.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;Screwworm Alert&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nov. 4, 2026 -&amp;nbsp;The park is within an infested zone for the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href='https://tpwd.texas.gov/huntwild/wild/diseases/screwworm/'&gt;new world screwworm&lt;/a&gt;. &amp;nbsp;For the safety of animals and to prevent the spread of this dangerous pest, please inspect pets daily for cuts, wounds and signs of infestation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;If you see animals with unusual wounds or maggots, do not move them.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Let someone know where you saw them:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For pets/livestock&lt;/strong&gt;: Contact park staff or the Animal Health Commission at (737) 900-7455.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For wildlife&lt;/strong&gt;: Contact park staff or call (512) 389-4505.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Check back for updates.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;Trail Closure&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;June 28, 2026 - A large part of the Lake Trail is closed due to maintenance and wet conditions. All other trails are open.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Park Closures&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The park will be closed on the following dates:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Noon on Nov. 15 to 2 p.m. on Nov. 20&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Noon on Nov. 29 to 2 p.m. on Dec. 4&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Noon on Jan. 17 to 2 p.m. on Jan. 22&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Only permitted hunters will be allowed on these dates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contact the park for more information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Check back for updates.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

