&lt;h3&gt;Area Closure&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Rancherias Loop hiking trail and Guale 1 and 2 campsites are closed April 19 through April 23, 2027 for Game Warden training activities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Park Closures&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The interior of the park will be closed on the following dates:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5 p.m. on Oct. 4 to 2 p.m. Oct. 8&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5 p.m. on Oct. 11 to 2 p.m. Oct. 15&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5 p.m. on Nov. 21 to 2 p.m. Nov. 25&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5 p.m. on Dec. 6 to 2 p.m. Dec. 10&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5 p.m. on Dec. 13 to 2 p.m. Dec. 17&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Only permitted hunters will be allowed into the interior of the park on these dates. Contact the park for more information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Sauceda Ranger Station&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sauceda Ranger Station hours vary and limited services are available. Shower and restrooms are available 24/7.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Check in for camping and day passes at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-val='e2a89eefa134bd503cd3f7fcebb337a6' href='https://tpwd.texas.gov/state-parks/fort-leaton' data-linktype='internal'&gt;Fort Leaton&lt;/a&gt; or&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-val='79ff78f9ce05f4d95d703145bb57fbbc' href='https://tpwd.texas.gov/state-parks/barton-warnock' data-linktype='internal'&gt;Barton Warnock&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Call either of these sites or&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href='mailto:BigBendRanchSP@tpwd.texas.gov' data-linktype='email' data-val='BigBendRanchSP@tpwd.texas.gov' data-subject=''&gt;email us&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;with questions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Souvenirs and concessions are only available at Fort Leaton or Barton Warnock.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Check back for updates.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;Burn Ban&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;July 28, 2026 - The park is under a burn ban. No open, ash-producing fires allowed, including wood or charcoal. You may use containerized fuel stoves (i.e. propane), for cooking.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Boat Ramp Closure&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Navasota River boat ramp will be closed from Oct. 19, 2026 to Jan. 10, 2027 for road work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Construction Alert&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Aug. 24, 2026 - TxDOT will be resurfacing the&amp;nbsp;roads in the park from October 2026 through May 2027. During this period, some facilities, campsites, and trails may be temporarily closed&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Aug. 26, 2026 - Expect construction noise in the day-use, screen shelter and cabin areas and the water and electric camping loop. Nature Center renovations are expected to last through spring 2027. Contact the park for details.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Fishing Piers Closed&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Jan. 7, 2025 - Both fishing piers are closed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Check back for updates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;

