&lt;p&gt;Oct. 31, 2026 - Horseback riding is not allowed in the park due to&amp;nbsp;&lt;span&gt;New World screwworm. Contact the park for details.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Reservations Recommended&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reservations are recommended&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;(even for those with park passes).&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href='https://texasstateparks.reserveamerica.com/franklin-mountains-state-park/r/facilityDetails.do?contractCode=TX&amp;amp;parkId=1200020&amp;amp;_ga=2.56606888.2022691743.1589809428-951694575.1519945245' data-linktype='external' data-val='https://texasstateparks.reserveamerica.com/franklin-mountains-state-park/r/facilityDetails.do?contractCode=TX&amp;amp;parkId=1200020&amp;amp;_ga=2.56606888.2022691743.1589809428-951694575.1519945245'&gt;Reserve online&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href='https://tpwd.texas.gov/state-parks/park-reservation-information/reservations#phone'&gt;call the Customer Service Center&lt;/a&gt; before you visit. Spanish-speaking agents are available at the CSC. Carry your pass (either a printed or digital version) with you while in the park.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Check back for updates.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;Special Event&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Lone Star Motorcycle Rally is taking place in Galveston Nov. 5 - 9, 2026.&amp;nbsp; Please use extra caution traveling to the park and expect motorcycle riders in and near the park.&lt;/p&gt;
