&lt;p&gt;April 29, 2026 - Scenic Overlook construction is suspended and two-way traffic is reopened. The sidewalk is closed, and no pedestrians or bicycles are allowed. Please proceed with caution and follow all signs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Trails in this area are closed, including parts of the Madrone Trail, Blinn River Trail, and the lower portion of the CCC Entrance Road Trail.&lt;/p&gt;
