&lt;h3&gt;Construction Alerts&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Aug. 11, 2026 - Multiple projects are underway in the park. Exercise caution in work areas:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We are improving some of our campsites. Expect intermittent closures for sites 1 - 24 and intermittent water disruptions. Watch for maintenance equipment on the east end of the island.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work on the headquarters parking lot will begin on Aug. 12. Headquarters will be open. Use caution when entering the park. We encourage you to &lt;a href='https://texasstateparks.reserveamerica.com/goose-island-state-park/r/facilityDetails.do?contractCode=TX&amp;amp;parkId=1200036&amp;amp;pk_vid=94a48e7fefd2fbfa17775687421526ac' data-linktype='external' data-val='https://texasstateparks.reserveamerica.com/goose-island-state-park/r/facilityDetails.do?contractCode=TX&amp;amp;parkId=1200036&amp;amp;pk_vid=94a48e7fefd2fbfa17775687421526ac'&gt;make reservations for camping and day passes&lt;/a&gt; in advance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Habitat restoration and marsh wetlands construction will begin in June 2026. This project will not affect campsites, but you will see maintenance equipment on the west end of the Island.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Water Conservation Alert&lt;/h3&gt;
