&lt;h3&gt;Screwworm Alert&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href='https://tpwd.texas.gov/huntwild/wild/diseases/screwworm/' data-linktype='external' data-val='https://tpwd.texas.gov/huntwild/wild/diseases/screwworm/'&gt;New world screwworm &lt;/a&gt;has been found in parts of Texas.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Check your pets and livestock often.&lt;/strong&gt; If you see unusual wounds or maggots, &lt;strong&gt;do not move the animal&lt;/strong&gt;. Call the Texas Animal Health Commission at (800) 550‑8242 or contact a private veterinarian.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For &lt;strong&gt;wildlife&lt;/strong&gt; with suspicious wounds or maggots, notify park staff or call (512) 389‑4505.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;Park Closures&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The park will be closed on the following dates:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sept. 4 through Sept. 6&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sept. 11 through Sept. 13&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sept. 19 through Sept. 20&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sept. 26 through Sept. 27&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Only permitted hunters will be allowed on these dates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contact the park for more information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contact the park for more information.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;Screwworm Alert&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href='https://tpwd.texas.gov/huntwild/wild/diseases/screwworm/' data-linktype='external' data-val='https://tpwd.texas.gov/huntwild/wild/diseases/screwworm/'&gt;New world screwworm &lt;/a&gt;has been found in parts of Texas.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Check your pets and livestock often.&lt;/strong&gt; If you see unusual wounds or maggots, &lt;strong&gt;do not move the animal&lt;/strong&gt;. Call the Texas Animal Health Commission at (800) 550‑8242 or contact a private veterinarian.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For &lt;strong&gt;wildlife&lt;/strong&gt; with suspicious wounds or maggots, notify park staff or call (512) 389‑4505.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;No Phones or Internet&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nov. 9, 2026 - Phones and internet connections are down at the park. Call (325) 450-5755 from 8:30 a.m. to 4:30 p.m. for assistance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Hunt Closures&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Some areas of the park will be closed for wildlife management activities on the following dates:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Oct. 23-25, Nov. 20-22:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;All trails south of the Burkett Trailhead and the Isabel Harte and Red Arroyo camping areas will close at 5 p.m. the day before the first day of the hunt and will reopen at 8 a.m. the day after the hunt ends. The Red Arroyo boat ramp and all other roads on the south side of the park will be closed.&amp;nbsp;The Lakeview (main) boat ramp will be open for waterfowl hunters, only.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nov. 3-5, Dec. 1-3:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;All trails north&amp;nbsp;of the Burkett Trailhead and the North Concho and Riverbend camping areas will close at 5 p.m. the day before the first day of the hunt and will reopen at 2 p.m. the day the hunt ends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Jan. 12-14, 2027:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;All trails north and west of the Red Arroyo Camping Area, and Isabel Harte, North Concho and Riverbend camping areas will close at 5 p.m. the day before the first day of the hunt and will reopen at 2 p.m. the day the hunt ends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;North Unit Gate Access&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Look for the gate code on your entry receipt or check in at the south gatehouse (362 S. FM 2288).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Check back for updates or contact the park for more information.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;Beach Closure&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Feb. 11, 2026 - The East Beach is closed to camping and vehicles, due to a wash-out.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Hunt Closures&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The marsh will be closed on the following dates:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nov. 7 until noon on Jan. 31&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Only hunters will be allowed in the marsh on these dates. The main area of the park will remain open.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Prescribed Burns&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Prescribed burns are planned from December through March, depending on weather and other factors. Smoke from these burns may affect your visit. Some camping areas, lodging facilities, trails, and day-use areas may be closed for your safety. Contact the park to learn more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Check back for updates.&lt;/p&gt;

