&lt;p&gt;March 23, 2026 - The Roadrunner Flat camping loop is closed for construction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Desert Vista campground and dump station will close beginning April 1, 2027 for upgrades.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Park Closures&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The park will be closed on the following dates:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Noon on Nov. 29 to 8 a.m. on Dec. 5&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Noon on Jan. 3 to 8 a.m. on Jan. 9&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Only permitted hunters will be allowed on these dates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contact the park for more information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Check back for updates.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;Special Event&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The park will be closed until 5 p.m. on Saturday, Oct. 17th, 2026 for the &lt;a data-val='da6e6f3cceca47d59c620ef0b8e4d47d' href='https://tpwd.texas.gov/calendar/sheldon-lake/halloween-in-the-park-3' data-linktype='internal'&gt;Annual Halloween in the Park&lt;/a&gt; event.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Parking will be offsite on the backside of CE King High School, in the student parking lot off of Innovation Rd. Free shuttles will be running through the night to and from the park.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Road Construction&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;May 2, 2026 - Construction is underway on Park Road 138. Sections of the park road are reduced to one lane. Parking is limited. Expect temporary closures of the park and the Prairie Boardwalk Trail. Please plan for extra drive time entering and exiting the park.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Check our &lt;a href='https://www.facebook.com/SheldonLakeStatePark/' data-linktype='external' data-val='https://www.facebook.com/SheldonLakeStatePark/'&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt; page for updates about closures.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Elevator Closure&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Feb. 21, 2026 - The elevator at the John Jacob Observation Tower is closed for maintenance. The tower remains open by stairs only at this time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Check back for updates.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;Screwworm Alert&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href='https://tpwd.texas.gov/huntwild/wild/diseases/screwworm/' data-linktype='external' data-val='https://tpwd.texas.gov/huntwild/wild/diseases/screwworm/'&gt;New world screwworm &lt;/a&gt;has been found in parts of Texas.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Check your pets and livestock often.&lt;/strong&gt; If you see unusual wounds or maggots, &lt;strong&gt;do not move the animal&lt;/strong&gt;. Call the Texas Animal Health Commission at (800) 550‑8242 or contact a private veterinarian.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For &lt;strong&gt;wildlife&lt;/strong&gt; with suspicious wounds or maggots, notify park staff or call (512) 389‑4505.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;Flooding Closures&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nov. 9, 2026 - The park is open, but some areas are closed due to potential flooding:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Upper River Trail parking lot&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;River Crossing parking lot&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interpretive Trail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Main day-use area&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Buck Lake Trail in the camping loop&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please exercise caution traveling to and from the park as there may be hazards due to rockslides on HWY 377.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Oct. 5, 2026 -&amp;nbsp;The South Llano River has changed course. The water may contain debris and hazards. Please use caution during any river recreation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Campground Closure&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Electric campsites 1-58 will be closed April through May 2027 for electrical work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Construction Notice&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;June 10, 2026 - Utility construction is underway in the park. Expect noise, construction traffic on the roadways, and possible road or lane closures.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span data-ogsc='black'&gt;&lt;span class='mark1qh55xz9j' data-markjs='true' data-ogac='' data-ogab='' data-ogsc='' data-ogsb='' data-ogsbtc='' data-ogsbrc='' data-ogsbbc='' data-ogsblc='' data-olk-copy-source='MessageBody'&gt;Holiday&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class='markx800977df' data-markjs='true' data-ogac='' data-ogab='' data-ogsc='' data-ogsb='' data-ogsbtc='' data-ogsbrc='' data-ogsbbc='' data-ogsblc=''&gt;Hours&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
