&lt;p&gt;Trail Racing Over Texas will be holding a run in the park. Expect heavy traffic on trails on&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong style='font-size: 1.23077rem;'&gt;Saturday, Nov. 7,&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style='font-size: 1.23077rem;'&gt; from 6 a.m. to 7 p.m. or later&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
