&lt;h3&gt;Shower Closure&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nov. 3, 2026 - The Lakeview camping area showers will be closed until Nov. 19, 2026 for maintenance. The Lakeview restrooms will remain open, and showers are available at the Blackjack Savannah camping area or the Bath House.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Trail Closure&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Blackjack camping loop and the EZ, A, and B trail loops will be closed on November 14. 2026 for a special event. C Loop, D loop, Whispering Pines, and the Lakeshore trails will remain open.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Low Lake Level&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Oct. 31, 2026 - The Southside fishing pier is closed, and boat rentals are unavailable due to low lake levels.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
